      "speaker": "店员",
      "zh": "你看，这个礼物在这儿。",
      "pinyin": "Nǐ kàn, zhège lǐwù zài zhèér.",
      "tr": "Bu hediye burada."
    },
    {
      "id": "DLG_ZH_HSK2_SC007_057",
